# Max column updraft velocity (m/s) — ICON's `updraft` field. Severe
# convection lives roughly 10-40 m/s (36.75 max observed on the
# 2026-08-13 ICON-D2 sample). Transparent below 1 m/s so synoptic lift
# doesn't paint the whole map.
